flowchart TD
    A["1. Khách có đơn hàng PENDING + UNPAID sau khi đặt hàng"]
    B["2. Frontend gọi POST /api/payments {orderId, method}"]
    C["3. PaymentService.createPayment(): tải Order theo orderId"]
    D["4. Tạo PAYMENT: amount=order.finalAmount, status=PENDING, method từ request"]
    E{"5. paymentMethod?"}
    F1["5a. COD: giữ nguyên, shipper thu tiền khi giao"]
    F2["5b. BANK_TRANSFER"]
    G2["6b. Frontend gọi GET /api/payments/qr/{orderId}"]
    H2["7b. PaymentService.getQRCode(): description='GREENPHONE'+orderId"]
    I2["8b. SepayService.generateQRUrl(): đọc SEPA_ACCOUNT_NUMBER, SEPA_BANK_CODE (MBB)"]
    J2["9b. Sinh VietQR URL → Khách quét mã, chuyển khoản với nội dung 'GREENPHONE{id}'"]
    K2["10b. Sepay webhook: POST /api/webhooks/sepay"]
    L2["11b. SepayWebhookController: xác thực chữ ký HMAC-SHA256 hoặc Apikey"]
    M2["12b. SepayService.processPaymentWebhook():"]
    N2["13b. Idempotency: paymentRepository.findByTransactionCode() → trả duplicate nếu đã xử lý"]
    O2["14b. extractOrderId(): parse 'GREENPHONE'+số từ nội dung CK → tìm Order"]
    P2["15b. Terminal guard: từ chối nếu order DELIVERED/CANCELLED"]
    Q2["16b. Amount check: transferAmount >= order.finalAmount"]
    R2["17b. Status guard: payment đã PAID → trả duplicate"]
    S2["18b. payment.status=PAID, transactionCode, paidAt=now → save"]
    T2["19b. order.paymentStatus=PAID, order.orderStatus=CONFIRMED → save"]
    U2["20b. Catch DataIntegrityViolationException → race condition an toàn"]
    V["21. OrderTimeoutScheduler (@Scheduled 60s): huỷ PENDING+UNPAID > 10 phút → hoàn tồn"]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E
    E --> F1
    E --> F2 --> G2 --> H2 --> I2 --> J2 --> K2 --> L2 --> M2 --> N2 --> O2 --> P2 --> Q2 --> R2 --> S2 --> T2 --> U2
    F1 --> V
    U2 --> V